, "scope": "Simulates the disclosed SQLite family (put mode x trigger x channel) and answers only when all candidates consistent with calibration agree.", "lesson": "Receipts pin put mode to INSERT OR IGNORE, no AFTER INSERT trigger, and channel = main changes() (last statement count)."}
